After C-c C-c finalizes a new AIU ("n" template), arrange its drawer
per `my/cyberdeck-drawer-key-order', then offer a completing-read
menu: open (capture) (the default) or open (buffer); the same two opens
combined with link insertion at origin; link insertion alone;
link insertion plus rename-and-propagate followed by either open;
or skip (origin restored). One-shot per
creation; aborted captures clear the pending path. The origin buffer
is never killed; every step is error-isolated.
